00:08:32,980 --> 00:08:34,020
<font size="64">- Hey. - I see.</font>

384
00:08:34,020 --> 00:08:35,190
<font size="64">He will turn 70 later.</font>

385
00:08:35,150 --> 00:08:37,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Feeling a prick of conscience)</font>

386
00:08:35,190 --> 00:08:37,220
<font size="64">- Age is just a number. - He has five years left.</font>

387
00:08:37,220 --> 00:08:38,360
<font size="64">- He looks really young for his age. - He said...</font>

388
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:40,120
<font size="64">- He said, "Age is just a number. - It's just a number.</font>

389
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,230
<font size="64">That's true.</font>

