980
00:21:35,500 --> 00:21:37,030
<font size="64">- Wasn't he an archer? - Did you say William Tell?</font>

981
00:21:37,130 --> 00:21:38,300
<font size="64">Do you think I'm that old?</font>

982
00:21:38,400 --> 00:21:42,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(From the darts' founding father to a legendary hunter)</font>

983
00:21:38,800 --> 00:21:40,540
<font size="64">- Hold on. - William Tell?</font>

984
00:21:40,540 --> 00:21:42,610
<font size="64">- Did I spend time in England? - William Tell.</font>

985
00:21:42,770 --> 00:21:45,680
<font size="64">Didn't you throw sticks that you sharpened yourself?</font>

986
00:21:45,810 --> 00:21:47,210
<font size="64">- I guess I could have. - Seok Jin.</font>

987
00:21:47,580 --> 00:21:48,980
<font size="64">- Seok Jin. - Wasn't it a dagger?</font>

988
00:21:48,980 --> 00:21:50,250
<font size="64">It could've been a dagger.</font>

989
00:21:49,110 --> 00:21:50,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Playing along)</font>

990
00:21:50,650 --> 00:21:52,380
<font size="64">Seok Jin is letting all the jokes land today.</font>

991
00:21:50,680 --> 00:21:52,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What's going on?)</font>

992
00:21:52,380 --> 00:21:54,120
<font size="64">- He's in great form today. - Yes, he's feeling great.</font>

993
00:21:53,020 --> 00:21:56,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's in the best mood to play along.)</font>

994
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:56,020
<font size="64">- I love it. - He isn't even getting angry.</font>

995
00:21:56,190 --> 00:21:58,220
<font size="64">It's fine. Besides, it's a great day today.</font>

996
00:21:58,220 --> 00:22:00,190
<font size="64">- Exactly. But why? - Why is it a great day?</font>

997
00:22:00,190 --> 00:22:01,630
<font size="64">- It just is. - The stock market took a dip.</font>

998
00:22:01,630 --> 00:22:03,560
<font size="64">Even if it drops, now...</font>

999
00:22:03,560 --> 00:22:05,260
<font size="64">- I just let it go. - Really?</font>

1000
00:22:05,330 --> 00:22:06,400
<font size="64">Yes, I just let it go.</font>

1001
00:22:05,830 --> 00:22:09,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jee Seok Sam is now immune to being in the red.)</font>

1002
00:22:06,530 --> 00:22:07,730
<font size="64">Of course. Now...</font>

1003
00:22:07,730 --> 00:22:09,870
<font size="64">- I'm not going to sell them. - Exactly.</font>

1004
00:22:09,870 --> 00:22:11,500
<font size="64">There was a time...</font>

1005
00:22:11,500 --> 00:22:12,840
<font size="64">when the stock market was all we talked about.</font>

1006
00:22:12,840 --> 00:22:14,400
<font size="64">I know. Things were crazy.</font>

1007
00:22:13,070 --> 00:22:16,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Being in the green was short and sweet.)</font>

1008
00:22:14,500 --> 00:22:16,140
<font size="64">- We were all happy. - Everyone was in a good mood.</font>

1009
00:22:16,140 --> 00:22:17,640
<font size="64">My heart broke over the stock market,</font>

1010
00:22:17,640 --> 00:22:19,380
<font size="64">- but even that scabbed over. - It went beyond that.</font>

1011
00:22:19,380 --> 00:22:21,380
<font size="64">- Of course. - It hurt so much...</font>

1012
00:22:21,380 --> 00:22:22,880
<font size="64">- that the wound healed over. - I see.</font>

1013
00:22:23,150 --> 00:22:25,050
<font size="64">Those who don't invest in the stock market...</font>

1014
00:22:25,050 --> 00:22:26,920
<font size="64">might be the real winners after all.</font>

1015
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:28,020
<font size="64">- Right. - Of course.</font>

1016
00:22:27,080 --> 00:22:28,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Glancing)</font>

1017
00:22:28,020 --> 00:22:29,250
<font size="64">But...</font>

1018
00:22:29,850 --> 00:22:31,150
<font size="64">- I'm holding out. - Ye Eun, tell them.</font>

1019
00:22:31,150 --> 00:22:32,920
<font size="64">- It's good if you make money. - Of course.</font>

1020
00:22:32,920 --> 00:22:34,190
<font size="64">She's having a hard time too.</font>

1021
00:22:34,190 --> 00:22:35,260
<font size="64">Ye Eun, do you invest in stocks too?</font>

1022
00:22:35,360 --> 00:22:37,630
<font size="64">- She got into it during this run. - I gave it a try.</font>

1023
00:22:38,100 --> 00:22:39,500
<font size="64">I'm down 47 percent.</font>

1024
00:22:40,100 --> 00:22:41,400
<font size="64">Oh, dear.</font>

1025
00:22:41,100 --> 00:22:44,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ddochi is at the summit.)</font>

1026
00:22:41,930 --> 00:22:43,370
<font size="64">- Ye Eun... - She only bought blue-chip stocks.</font>

1027
00:22:43,370 --> 00:22:45,200
<font size="64">Didn't you get into it against our advice?</font>

1028
00:22:44,030 --> 00:22:45,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Being hateful)</font>

1029
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:47,100
<font size="64">- You tried to stop me. - We told you to stay away.</font>

1030
00:22:45,600 --> 00:22:47,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Bitter)</font>

1031
00:22:47,100 --> 00:22:48,770
<font size="64">But I dreamed of hitting it big too.</font>

1032
00:22:48,840 --> 00:22:51,070
<font size="64">- Well, everyone was making money. - Everyone around her...</font>

1033
00:22:50,040 --> 00:22:52,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A textbook retail investor)</font>

1034
00:22:51,070 --> 00:22:52,910
<font size="64">was talking about the stock market.</font>

1035
00:22:52,510 --> 00:22:56,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Everyone would've downloaded the stock app back then.)</font>

1036
00:22:52,910 --> 00:22:54,880
<font size="64">- She got swayed... - How could you not, right?</font>

1037
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:56,310
<font size="64">by all the talk.</font>

1038
00:22:56,310 --> 00:22:58,010
<font size="64">- Of course. Besides, - That's right.</font>

1039
00:22:58,010 --> 00:22:59,150
<font size="64">the FOMO is real.</font>

1040
00:22:59,150 --> 00:23:01,720
<font size="64">- You're afraid you're missing out. - That's right.</font>

1041
00:23:01,720 --> 00:23:04,050
<font size="64">I doubt many of them know what FOMO is.</font>

1042
00:23:05,060 --> 00:23:06,360
<font size="64">I understood the gist of it.</font>

1043
00:23:05,460 --> 00:23:08,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Confessing)</font>

1044
00:23:06,360 --> 00:23:07,760
<font size="64">- Really? FOMO? - Which is what?</font>

1045
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:10,090
<font size="64">You're afraid you'll miss out on something.</font>

1046
00:23:10,090 --> 00:23:11,290
<font size="64">- Nice. - Not bad.</font>

1047
00:23:10,630 --> 00:23:12,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Impressed)</font>

1048
00:23:11,760 --> 00:23:13,830
<font size="64">I'm the living embodiment of FOMO.</font>

1049
00:23:14,560 --> 00:23:17,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam is suddenly upset.)</font>

1050
00:23:15,330 --> 00:23:17,270
<font size="64">- You can't take it. - I lose sleep over it.</font>

1051
00:23:17,270 --> 00:23:19,300
<font size="64">I'm sorry about this, but...</font>

1052
00:23:19,300 --> 00:23:21,070
<font size="64">- What is it? - Aren't we giving Chan Hee gifts?</font>

1053
00:23:21,810 --> 00:23:23,370
<font size="64">- We should be talking about that. - Hold on.</font>

1054
00:23:23,370 --> 00:23:25,610
<font size="64">You've been talking about something else this whole time.</font>

1055
00:23:25,780 --> 00:23:27,440
<font size="64">- How far do we need to take this? - Give him stocks, then.</font>

1056
00:23:27,640 --> 00:23:30,180
<font size="64">You could've just told us to stop, you punk.</font>

1057
00:23:30,210 --> 00:23:32,380
<font size="64">- Why are you raising your voice? - There's no need to get angry.</font>

1058
00:23:30,980 --> 00:23:33,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His condition has turned red.)</font>

1059
00:23:32,380 --> 00:23:33,420
<font size="64">That's not it.</font>

1060
00:23:33,420 --> 00:23:34,480
<font size="64">- We were all talking. - There's no need for that.</font>

1061
00:23:34,620 --> 00:23:35,820
<font size="64">Why are you only telling me...</font>

1062
00:23:35,820 --> 00:23:37,020
<font size="64">- to stop? - Hold on.</font>

1063
00:23:37,090 --> 00:23:39,320
<font size="64">- He's like a kid. - Unbelievable.</font>

1064
00:23:37,490 --> 00:23:40,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Where did they land with Seok Jin, who's like the stock market itself?)</font>

1065
00:23:40,590 --> 00:23:41,690
<font size="64">What on earth is this?</font>

1066
00:23:41,690 --> 00:23:42,830
<font size="64">Wait, what's this?</font>

1067
00:23:43,130 --> 00:23:44,860
<font size="64">- Cones were set up everywhere. - Right.</font>

1068
00:23:43,260 --> 00:23:46,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A cone-lined path stretching from the inside out)</font>

1069
00:23:44,860 --> 00:23:46,530
<font size="64">I bet it's a relay.</font>

1070
00:23:46,530 --> 00:23:48,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What are we doing here?)</font>

1071
00:23:46,900 --> 00:23:48,970
<font size="64">- What's that? - What do they have planned?</font>

1072
00:23:48,970 --> 00:23:52,200
<font size="64">In this next game, you'll play to win darts and lunch.</font>

1073
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:54,170
<font size="64">- We need to do this right. - We have to do well on this one.</font>

1074
00:23:54,170 --> 00:23:55,840
<font size="64">- This is Draw at Full Speed. - We have to nail this.</font>

1075
00:23:55,840 --> 00:23:56,870
<font size="64">- At full speed? - At full speed?</font>

1076
00:23:56,870 --> 00:23:58,910
<font size="64">- Four of you must compete. - Okay.</font>

1077
00:23:58,910 --> 00:24:02,210
<font size="64">Three of you will get the answer, then go to your starting positions.</font>

1078
00:24:02,210 --> 00:24:05,620
<font size="64">The first participant must then run as they start to draw.</font>

1079
00:24:05,750 --> 00:24:08,950
<font size="64">The sketchbook is passed to the next runner like a baton.</font>

1080
00:24:09,020 --> 00:24:12,920
<font size="64">The fourth person must guess the answer from the drawing.</font>

1081
00:24:11,990 --> 00:24:14,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Correct)</font>

1082
00:24:12,920 --> 00:24:14,660
<font size="64">- That's hard. - How do we do that?</font>

1083
00:24:14,660 --> 00:24:16,590
<font size="64">- The time limit is 30 seconds. - What?</font>

1084
00:24:16,590 --> 00:24:18,760
<font size="64">- That's too short. - All three runners must draw.</font>

1085
00:24:18,760 --> 00:24:21,060
<font size="64">- Jong Kook's good at drawing. - You can't use numbers or letters.</font>

1086
00:24:19,960 --> 00:24:22,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(No letters or numbers allowed.)</font>

1087
00:24:21,160 --> 00:24:22,300
<font size="64">My gosh...</font>

1088
00:24:22,070 --> 00:24:24,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Everything has to be conveyed through drawings.)</font>

1089
00:24:22,300 --> 00:24:23,800
<font size="64">- While we run? - While we run?</font>

1090
00:24:23,800 --> 00:24:26,100
<font size="64">- That's tough. - What are the categories?</font>

1091
00:24:26,100 --> 00:24:28,100
<font size="64">- They're proverbs. Yes. - Proverbs?</font>

1092
00:24:28,100 --> 00:24:29,210
<font size="64">- Not bad. - Proverbs are hard.</font>

1093
00:24:29,070 --> 00:24:31,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Proverb genius)</font>

1094
00:24:29,210 --> 00:24:30,910
<font size="64">- Shouldn't Ye Eun run? - She should.</font>

1095
00:24:30,910 --> 00:24:32,040
<font size="64">- Ye Eun should run. - For entertainment.</font>

1096
00:24:32,040 --> 00:24:33,810
<font size="64">- She can draw well too. - Yes.</font>

1097
00:24:32,080 --> 00:24:35,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Empty Head Ji, her only forte is proverbs and drawings.)</font>

1098
00:24:33,810 --> 00:24:35,050
<font size="64">- I can draw. - Yes.</font>

1099
00:24:35,050 --> 00:24:36,810
<font size="64">- There are seven questions. - Okay.</font>

1100
00:24:36,810 --> 00:24:39,680
<font size="64">- Seven questions. - The number of side dishes...</font>

1101
00:24:39,680 --> 00:24:41,720
<font size="64">are also seven, and each time you fail...</font>

1102
00:24:41,180 --> 00:24:43,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Every time they get it wrong, one of the side dishes will be removed.)</font>

1103
00:24:41,720 --> 00:24:43,850
<font size="64">- That's harsh. - That's not fair.</font>

1104
00:24:43,850 --> 00:24:46,320
<font size="64">- You lose what you like most. - I'm hurt.</font>

1105
00:24:46,320 --> 00:24:48,890
<font size="64">That means you just want to start a fight.</font>

1106
00:24:48,890 --> 00:24:51,030
<font size="64">- Don't use food against us. - Food...</font>

1107
00:24:49,130 --> 00:24:51,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mr. Free Meals is mad.)</font>

1108
00:24:51,030 --> 00:24:52,460
<font size="64">I'll show you the full menu.</font>

1109
00:24:51,700 --> 00:24:53,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(7 side dishes are coming.)</font>

1110
00:24:52,830 --> 00:24:53,900
<font size="64">Look!</font>

1111
00:24:54,930 --> 00:24:56,900
<font size="64">- That's a feast. - We must try hard.</font>

1112
00:24:56,800 --> 00:24:58,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Passionate)</font>

1113
00:24:56,900 --> 00:24:58,400
<font size="64">- Let's get everything right. - Gosh.</font>

1114
00:24:58,300 --> 00:24:59,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(1. Spicy stir-fried pork, 2. Steak with herbs)</font>

1115
00:24:58,400 --> 00:24:59,740
<font size="64">- What the... - That's insane.</font>

1116
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:01,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(4. Seaweed soup, 6. Young radish mulkimchi, seasoned perilla leaves)</font>

1117
00:24:59,740 --> 00:25:01,040
<font size="64">- I can't lose any. - It's too much.</font>

1118
00:25:01,040 --> 00:25:02,770
<font size="64">- Japchae? - Just seaweed soup and rice...</font>

1119
00:25:01,540 --> 00:25:03,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(7. Orange salad, acorn jelly)</font>

1120
00:25:02,770 --> 00:25:04,170
<font size="64">- is delicious enough. - We need seasoned perilla leaves.</font>

1121
00:25:03,140 --> 00:25:05,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(From appetizing Korean side dishes...)</font>

1122
00:25:04,170 --> 00:25:05,810
<font size="64">- Spicy stir-fried pork. - My favorites...</font>

1123
00:25:05,780 --> 00:25:09,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(to delicious and nutritious meat dishes)</font>

1124
00:25:05,810 --> 00:25:07,210
<font size="64">- are all here. - The steak.</font>

1125
00:25:07,210 --> 00:25:08,810
<font size="64">- Steak with herbs. - We just need the pork.</font>

1126
00:25:08,810 --> 00:25:10,750
<font size="64">- No, the steak. - It looks so good.</font>

1127
00:25:10,210 --> 00:25:12,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(These 7 dishes are the members' favorites.)</font>

1128
00:25:10,750 --> 00:25:12,550
<font size="64">Don't they all look great?</font>

1129
00:25:12,550 --> 00:25:14,380
<font size="64">- We just need the spicy pork. - The pork.</font>

1130
00:25:14,380 --> 00:25:16,120
<font size="64">- A man's favorite! - Spicy pork!</font>

1131
00:25:14,420 --> 00:25:17,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Spicy stir-fried pork sent their enthusiasm through the roof.)</font>

1132
00:25:16,120 --> 00:25:17,390
<font size="64">We just need the spicy pork.</font>

1133
00:25:17,390 --> 00:25:18,660
<font size="64">- The menu... - Pork is all we need.</font>

1134
00:25:18,660 --> 00:25:20,520
<font size="64">- Spicy pork! - Just one.</font>

1135
00:25:20,520 --> 00:25:21,760
<font size="64">- The thing is, - Pork is all we need.</font>

1136
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:23,360
<font size="64">you lose them in numerical order.</font>

1137
00:25:23,360 --> 00:25:24,560
<font size="64">- Shoot. - That's not fair.</font>

1138
00:25:24,560 --> 00:25:26,830
<font size="64">- We should decide. - Let us choose what to lose.</font>

1139
00:25:25,260 --> 00:25:28,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(1. Spicy stir-fried pork, 2. Steak with herbs)</font>

1140
00:25:26,830 --> 00:25:28,370
<font size="64">- Shall we fight? - Wait.</font>

1141
00:25:28,370 --> 00:25:29,770
<font size="64">Numerical order is too cruel.</font>

1142
00:25:29,770 --> 00:25:33,100
<font size="64">That's not fair. Let us pick one by one.</font>

1143
00:25:31,530 --> 00:25:33,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Checking the temperature)</font>

1144
00:25:33,800 --> 00:25:35,810
<font size="64">Jong Kook, it's warm. We must play now.</font>

1145
00:25:35,810 --> 00:25:37,710
<font size="64">- Let's play. - The food is warm.</font>

1146
00:25:35,940 --> 00:25:38,840
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They'll quickly start the challenge before the food gets cold.)</font>

1147
00:25:37,710 --> 00:25:39,240
<font size="64">Due to stamina issues,</font>

1148
00:25:39,240 --> 00:25:40,780
<font size="64">- the two groups will take turns. - Okay.</font>

1149
00:25:40,780 --> 00:25:43,350
<font size="64">Jong Kook and Haha are the two resident artists.</font>

1150
00:25:43,380 --> 00:25:45,820
<font size="64">- You each pick a team to lead. - That's fair.</font>

1151
00:25:45,820 --> 00:25:48,020
<font size="64">I'll take these landmines.</font>

1152
00:25:46,550 --> 00:25:48,020
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Serious)</font>

1153
00:25:48,020 --> 00:25:50,590
<font size="64">- "Landmines?" - We survived with wit.</font>

1154
00:25:48,020 --> 00:25:49,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The landmines are offended.)</font>

1155
00:25:50,590 --> 00:25:52,490
<font size="64">- Was that too mean? - You do that.</font>

1156
00:25:52,490 --> 00:25:53,960
<font size="64">- Jae Seok can guess. - Yes.</font>

1157
00:25:53,820 --> 00:25:56,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok has gotten so much better at drawing.)</font>

1158
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:56,960
<font size="64">- His drawing got much better. - I did.</font>

1159
00:25:56,190 --> 00:25:57,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seal, Bongeun Temple, horse, Ji Ye Eun)</font>

1160
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:58,260
<font size="64">I improved over the years.</font>

1161
00:25:57,790 --> 00:26:01,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(And this is what his "improved" drawing looks like.)</font>

1162
00:25:58,260 --> 00:26:00,460
<font size="64">Despite the improvement, no one can decipher his art.</font>

1163
00:26:00,560 --> 00:26:02,030
<font size="64">I'll guess the answer.</font>

1164
00:26:02,030 --> 00:26:04,570
<font size="64">- You know many proverbs. - I do. I lived those times.</font>

1165
00:26:04,570 --> 00:26:05,800
<font size="64">- That's right. - Yes.</font>

1166
00:26:05,800 --> 00:26:07,300
<font size="64">We have to run, right?</font>

1167
00:26:06,440 --> 00:26:11,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok, Seok Jin, Haha, and Se Chan go first.)</font>

1168
00:26:07,300 --> 00:26:09,110
<font size="64">How do you draw as you run?</font>

1169
00:26:09,110 --> 00:26:10,640
<font size="64">You should go first, then.</font>

1170
00:26:11,010 --> 00:26:13,810
<font size="64">- Me? - Go first and set the tone.</font>

